      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──模拟赛那天。\n双涡轮跑出强势领头，\n享受极限状态并且获胜了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da41844ea3964f642f934daea7a8f983781105df346b5eba079a7e96417826cb",
