    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc8a007d42186df3c70d7ce0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我抱头苦恼着。\n虽然她的跑法极具魅力……\n但她身上的问题实在是太多、太棘手了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "26976ed5792f1e7b69db2d4f5a1d5d2ffad8f43a481956ff55c82f1f5ad9f7d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
