      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先要怎样才能拼到出道呢？\n我们必须想方设法通过\n其他赛马娘都能轻松度过的第一道关卡……",
      "source_fingerprint": "789887f346632ec243693438741e621709debcbebbcc1da79b8a6414cdd5d4af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
