      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而在后面追着她的，是她的同期，\n缺乏自信的赛马娘优秀素质。然后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7f33847613508b7e085f69dfe21a2969d9100ea53aca9005bea9903fee399b9",
